title: "C20 — Outbox state and lease recovery · Implemented"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> pending: Transaction commits event
  pending --> dispatching: Dispatcher claims due row
  dispatching --> queued: Queue accepts reference
  queued --> dispatching: Recheck becomes due
  pending --> processing: Worker claims event
  dispatching --> processing: Worker wins before enqueue acknowledgement
  queued --> processing: Worker claims event
  dispatching --> pending: Retryable enqueue failure
  dispatching --> failed: Invalid stored envelope
  processing --> pending: Retryable processing or publish failure
  processing --> failed: Invalid persisted relationships
  processing --> delivered: Persist, publish, then complete
  dispatching --> dispatching: Expired lease reclaimed
  processing --> dispatching: Dispatcher reclaims expired lease
  processing --> processing: Worker reclaims expired lease
  delivered --> [*]
